Dear R and S People:

I ended up using the "assign" command, and things work in S+.

boot1 <- function(y,method="f",p=1) {
n1 <- length(y)
#n2 <- n1*p
assign("n2",n1*p)
n3 <- n2 - 1
a <- 0.5*(outer(1:n3,1:n3,function(x,y){n2 - pmax(x,y)}))
return(a)
}

thanks for listening!

Sincerely,
